&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is needed to help combat fraud and abuse on our communications platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a curious, analytical and quick thinking individual to join our global Fraud Operations team. This is a full time role, located in Estonia. In this role, you will utilize a variety of tools to prevent, respond and mitigate instances of fraud and abuse across all of our products, protecting our customers and our platform.&lt;/p&gt;
