&lt;p&gt;As Marketing Strategy &amp;amp; Planning Manager, you will be a critical engine driver of our global marketing organization. In this role, you will turn strategic vision into operational reality—managing the infrastructure, processes, and data-driven insights that allow our marketing team to scale predictably and efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role requiring a blend of analytical execution and sharp project management skills. You will help manage the day-to-day rhythm of the business, translating complex data into actionable insights while maintaining a high bar for operational rigor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Planning&lt;/strong&gt;: Translate business goals into actionable marketing strategies and scalable operational frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Insights&lt;/strong&gt;: Deep-dive into complex marketing performance data. Surface trends, identify bottlenecks, and package these findings into clear, actionable reports that support leadership in crafting the overarching performance narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze the Funnel&lt;/strong&gt;: Diagnose opportunities to improve the marketing funnel and pipeline creation. Maintain and optimize our marketing measurement foundation. Track and analyze account-to-opportunity mapping, pipeline attribution models, and funnel velocity metrics to provide clarity on GTM performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational PMO&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead day-to-day Marketing project management. Track the execution of critical cross-functional initiatives, translating high-level corporate goals into actionable project roadmaps with measurable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Act as the strategic communication bridge between Marketing &amp;amp; GTM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
