&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The High Operato&lt;/strong&gt;r: 3-5 years of experience in Marketing Operations, Revenue Operations, or Management Consulting within a B2B SaaS environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
