&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Based in the San Francisco Bay area, California:&lt;/strong&gt; $78,000 - $105,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
