&lt;p&gt;Twilio values diverse experiences from all kinds of industries, and we encourage everyone who meets the required qualifications to apply. If your career is just starting or hasn&#39;t followed a traditional path, don&#39;t let that stop you from considering Twilio. We are always looking for people who will bring something new to the table!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in developing technical data and automation solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience working with SQL and relational database schemas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with Google Sheets (or Excel), Tableau, and/or Looker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Python, APIs, or workflow platforms (e.g., Airtable, Coefficient, Zapier/n8n) to build automated data workflows and process pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building agents (e.g. Claude Code, Claude Cowork, OpenAI, Gemini) and training LLM models to solve complex, multi-step, unstructured problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding and orientation toward data management, governance, and hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp written and verbal communication skills to articulate findings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to break down business problems into manageable pieces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of using technology safely with frameworks and metrics to ensure accuracy, efficiency, maintainability, and safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with telecom, messaging, and voice networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SaaS, technology, management consulting, or investment banking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in project management and communicating requirements to data teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with customers, vendors, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
