&lt;p&gt;You will be part of a company that is the category leader in Communications Platform as a Service (CPaaS), an organization working with the largest customers and partners, and a team of operators and former consultants that have delivered exceptional impact in product-led growth, international expansion, compliance, and go-to-market. If you have an extreme owner / founder mindset and a desire to solve big challenges, you’ll find yourself at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic AI &amp;amp; Workflow Automation
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect, test, and deploy LLMs and agents to automate unstructured, multi-step data investigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect, test, and deploy automated workflows (using Python) to transform repetitive manual processes into scalable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect, test and deploy single-user tools and multi-user workflows to drive human efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement strong data architecture and AI orchestration frameworks for safety, accuracy, efficiency and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytics, Modeling &amp;amp; Root Cause Analysis
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform SQL queries and multi-step data analyses across complex telecommunications datasets to optimize gross margins, reduce fraud, and improve network quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design dashboards and repeatable BI solutions (using Tableau, Looker, or Python) that deliver actionable insights to business partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define key performance indicators (KPIs) and track performance over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership &amp;amp; Ownership
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Carrier Relations, Enterprise Technology, Product, Supply Operations, and Finance to translate complex business needs into data requirements and governance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and verbally communicate insights that directly answer business questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a self-starter who takes end-to-end ownership of data products – from scoping requirements and authoring documentation to final execution and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure projects are delivered on time and to a high standard, positively impacting customer experience and company success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio values diverse experiences from all kinds of industries, and we encourage everyone who meets the required qualifications to apply. If your career is just starting or hasn&#39;t followed a traditional path, don&#39;t let that stop you from considering Twilio. We are always looking for people who will bring something new to the table!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in developing technical data and automation solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience working with SQL and relational database schemas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with Google Sheets (or Excel), Tableau, and/or Looker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Python, APIs, or workflow platforms (e.g., Airtable, Coefficient, Zapier/n8n) to build automated data workflows and process pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building agents (e.g. Claude Code, Claude Cowork, OpenAI, Gemini) and training LLM models to solve complex, multi-step, unstructured problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding and orientation toward data management, governance, and hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp written and verbal communication skills to articulate findings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to break down business problems into manageable pieces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of using technology safely with frameworks and metrics to ensure accuracy, efficiency, maintainability, and safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with telecom, messaging, and voice networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SaaS, technology, management consulting, or investment banking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in project management and communicating requirements to data teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with customers, vendors, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
