&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex technical tradeoffs between reliability, scalability, and feature development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of successfully delivering critical infrastructure projects with significant technical complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in improving developer velocity using AI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of performance optimization, reliability engineering, and operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
