&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of analytical experience with fluency in analytics tools (e.g. Python, Looker, SQL, Tableau)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience leveraging data to uncover insights, and communicating to leadership teams to influence business strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative team player who thrives in cross-functional teams and is adept at building relationships across diverse groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative and strategic thinker with a passion for leveraging data to drive innovation and improvement in marketing practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Marketing, Business, Statistics, or a related field. Advanced degrees or certifications in analytics, data science, or similar fields will be highly regarded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on or with AI products (e.g., LLMs, copilots, RAG apps, workflow tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior direct experience building or co-building an MMM model, or working as an embedded analytics partner to an MMM/data science team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in B2B marketing analytics, consulting, or an agency environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple regions or in a global, matrixed organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
