&lt;p&gt;The estimated pay ranges for this role are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Base Salary : CAD 132,640.00 - 165,800.00&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus : 12.5%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
