&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Sr. Manager, Global Sales Business Partners (SBP) to drive the Sales Operations rhythms and strategic projects across Field Sales, Specialists, and Partners. Serving as a hands-on operational manager with high exposure to senior sales executives, you will champion a sales-first mindset, foster cross-functional collaboration, and drive operational excellence to accelerate growth. The ideal candidate is a hands-on builder with deep go-to-market (GTM) and Project Management knowledge, and enterprise-scale software/tech experience in sales strategy, planning, and operations. Success in this cross-functional role relies on building tight alignment with peer Sales Operations leaders, including Strategic Operations, Sales Compensation, GTM Analytics, and Enablement, as well as company-wide teams like HR, Finance, Marketing, and Product.&lt;/p&gt;
