&lt;li&gt;Lead the execution of multiple rhythms of our operating cadence with Global Sales leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a high-performance culture focused on collaboration, accountability and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with each BP in our organization, and other roles in the broader organization, to support leadership requests, drive high impact projects and ensure alignment of deliverables across different regions.&lt;/li&gt;
