&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce Application Architect Experience: 10 years of extensive experience with Salesforce and Order-to-Cash implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CLM Tool Expertise: 5+ years of experience designing and implementing large-scale automation within a CLM and e-signature tool (preferably Conga + DocuSign) inside the Salesforce ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Technical Skills: Advanced knowledge of Salesforce declarative automation, Conga X-Author, document templates, and DocuSign APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Communication &amp;amp; Documentation: Demonstrated ability to capture thinking, recommendations, and process mappings in clear, highly detailed documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Assertiveness: Proven track record of operating as a strategic partner who can constructively challenge stakeholders and leadership in the interest of system scalability and long-term sustainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of successfully leading and delivering complex, cross-functional strategic initiatives in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical with a data-driven approach to problem-solving and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to think strategically and translate complex or ambiguous concepts into actionable plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desired Qualifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
