&lt;p&gt;Join the team as Twilio’s next Transfer Pricing Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio is looking for an Transfer Pricing&amp;nbsp; Manager located in the US to join our global tax team.&amp;nbsp; As the Global Transfer Pricing Manager at Twilio, you will be an architect and guardian of our intercompany transaction framework. In a high-growth, cloud-communications environment, our value chain is complex—spanning R&amp;amp;D, digital infrastructure, and global sales. You will ensure that our global operations are compliant, tax-efficient, and aligned with the latest OECD guidelines and local regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You aren&#39;t just a &quot;compliance checker&quot;; you are a strategic partner who understands how code, data, and communication APIs translate into taxable value across borders.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Our ideal candidate is a highly motivated and collaborative individual with transfer pricing experience and an eagerness to learn in an AI native environment . We aren’t just &quot;filing forms&quot;; we are building a scalable, &lt;strong&gt;AI-native tax infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; that supports a company moving at the speed of the cloud. You will have the autonomy to design processes from scratch—moving away from manual data entry toward high-value strategic analysis enabled by the latest AI tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the charge in integrating AI and automation into our transfer pricing workflow. This includes automating benchmark searches, using AI for draft local file narratives, and building &quot;self-service&quot; intercompany models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the end-to-end global transfer pricing lifecycle, including the preparation and review of Master Files, Local Files, and Country-by-Country Reporting (CbCR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the operational transfer pricing process—setting, monitoring, and adjusting intercompany prices throughout the year to ensure legal entities hit target profitability as well as ensure that the quarterly close calculations are robust and accurate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document complex intercompany transactions and develop robust policies for the valuation of intangible assets (IP), know-how, and customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage global transfer pricing audits and controversy matters, acting as the primary point of contact for external advisors and tax authorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio values diverse experiences from all kinds of industries, and we encourage everyone who meets the required qualifications to apply. If your career is just starting or hasn&#39;t followed a traditional path, don&#39;t let that stop you from considering Twilio. We are always looking for people who will bring something new to the table!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Economics, Finance, or Law. CPA, CTA, or JD/LLM in Tax is highly preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-10 years of dedicated transfer pricing experience in Big 4 public accounting or a high-growth US multinational corporation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Oracle Fusion or similar ERP/ EPM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be proficient with Microsoft Excel/Office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tax technology software &amp;amp; AI tools&amp;nbsp; is beneficial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be remote US,&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;but is not eligible to be hired in CA&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
